# O'Brien targets an artifact-only Chalice you control, not either opponent's artifact or your land (CR 603.3d).
# Bot2 drawing its second card never triggers him. On turn 3 your first draw does not trigger; Opt's single draw
# is the second and doubles two charge counters to four (CR 121.1, 701.10e). Recall's third/fourth/fifth draws do not.
# On the opponent's turn, Recall draws your first/second/third: a fresh second draw doubles four to eight, not sixteen.
# Turn 5's first draw does not trigger; its second targets the creature-only O'Brien himself, which has no counters
# and gains none. Thus the target need not be an artifact, another permanent, or already have counters.

